<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90030" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσρησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>addressing</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διδοὺς πρόσρησιν
				ἑξῆς πᾶσι</span>
			<i>accosting</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				341
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῦ θεοῦ τῶν εἰσιόντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Chrm.</u>
					164d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Hier.</u>
				8.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ οἰκέτου π</span>.
			<i>address</i> to . ., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				777e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἐξόδοισι γὰρ ἔθαψα . . σ᾽
				ἕνεκ᾽ ἐμῆς π</span>. to enable me <i>to address</i>
			thee, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1166
			</span></i>; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ σὸς δὲ τύμβος . . τοῖς ἐμπόροις π.
					ἔσται πανταχοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.Com.
					183
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>advice, recommendation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>naming</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				258a
			</span></i>; <i>designation</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				306e
			</span></i>: c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				4p.425M.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in Logic, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθ᾽ ἑκάστην πρόσρησιν</span> according to
				<i>the mode added</i> in each case, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APr.</u>
				25a3
			</span></i>.</div>
